### What are you trying to achieve?

Multiple Tax Classes can be created with the same name, even though Tax Classes should have unique names.

### Steps to reproduce the problem

1. Open Saleor GraphQL playground or POSTMAN. Use TokenCreate API to create Token.
2. Use the token generated to call TaxClassCreate API.
3. Create a new Tax Class with a specific name (e.g., "New tax class") and provide other details.
4. Verify the tax class got created with name "New tax class".
5. Repeat the process and attempt to create another Tax Class with the same name ("New tax class").

### What did you expect to happen?

